1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 12=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:42,480
Old Master.

7
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:45,640
What if Young Master wasn't the only one

8
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:47,040
wearing a larkspur flower ornament?

9
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:49,200
If you and Master Lin

10
00:01:49,430 --> 00:01:50,920
also wore larkspur flower ornaments,

11
00:01:50,930 --> 00:01:52,120
or even if all the male guests

12
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,680
wore larkspur flower ornaments,

13
00:01:53,790 --> 00:01:55,310
then even if Young Master wore one,

14
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,920
it wouldn't imply
any romantic involvement.

15
00:01:58,680 --> 00:01:59,790
We've already sent people

16
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,200
to find clever women
skilled with their hands

17
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:04,480
to learn how to make
larkspur flower ornaments.

18
00:02:05,310 --> 00:02:06,480
But on such short notice,

19
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:09,310
there's no telling
if they can even make them,

20
00:02:09,630 --> 00:02:11,590
let alone make so many.

21
00:02:13,870 --> 00:02:14,800
I think

22
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,120
Luxue Lodge

23
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:18,648
should still have some finished
larkspur flower ornaments.

24
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:21,520
Young Lady Du would never do anything

25
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:24,344
as improper as privately
exchanging gifts without a matchmaker.

26
00:02:25,110 --> 00:02:26,888
She must have made
too many flower ornaments

27
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:28,510
and accidentally, in all the confusion,

28
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:30,952
mixed one in with the festive
ornaments for Young Master.

29
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:35,190
I was only making a desperate attempt,

30
00:02:35,310 --> 00:02:36,590
taking a chance on my guess.

31
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:38,800
Fortunately, I asked Xiaolian,

32
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:42,232
and Young Lady Du really did have more
larkspur flower ornaments in her room.

33
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,750
Yuchan said you enjoy reading.

34
00:02:49,176 --> 00:02:50,920
From now on,
the books in the Inner Study,

35
00:02:50,984 --> 00:02:52,680
except those locked away in the chests,

36
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:53,960
all the others

37
00:02:54,568 --> 00:02:56,536
are yours to borrow whenever you like.

38
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,360
Thank you, Young Master.

39
00:03:04,870 --> 00:03:05,750
What you did today

40
00:03:06,630 --> 00:03:07,910
was both brave and resourceful.

41
00:03:07,928 --> 00:03:09,780
You handled everything
swiftly and thoroughly.

42
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:11,160
You deserve a generous reward.

43
00:03:12,030 --> 00:03:12,840
What would you like?

44
00:03:13,896 --> 00:03:16,280
First Madam already rewarded me
with ten taels of gold.

45
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:19,470
I'd like a day off to go home
and spend time with my parents,

46
00:03:19,870 --> 00:03:21,750
and ask Uncle Liu to make the slingshot.

47
00:03:27,430 --> 00:03:30,150
And I'd also like
to ask Young Master for something.

48
00:03:34,310 --> 00:03:34,710
Go ahead.

49
00:03:34,872 --> 00:03:36,152
What would you like?

50
00:03:38,168 --> 00:03:40,590
I heard the ointment used
in the army for treating chilblains

51
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:43,190
works much better
than the ones sold at pharmacies.

52
00:03:43,630 --> 00:03:44,560
I'd like some.

53
00:03:47,430 --> 00:03:49,150
My mother has chilblains on her hands.

54
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:56,190
All right.

55
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:58,560
I'll have Nanke get you a bottle.

56
00:04:00,568 --> 00:04:01,630
Thank you, Young Master.

57
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,710
Lingdang can help
apply the medicine for me.

58
00:04:08,910 --> 00:04:10,360
How could I trouble you, Young Lady?

59
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,630
I'm the one who studied medicine,

60
00:04:13,910 --> 00:04:15,080
not Lingdang.

61
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:18,830
They struck you so hard.

62
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:21,000
Even with the good medicine
Nanny Wu sent,

63
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:22,920
it'll still leave a scar.

64
00:04:25,430 --> 00:04:26,920
You were foolish, too.

65
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:28,920
Twenty strikes with the ruler.

66
00:04:29,430 --> 00:04:30,870
If you'd taken ten on each hand

67
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:32,870
and split the punishment between them,

68
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,920
your injury wouldn't be this severe.

69
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:38,920
Yuchan said we
still had duties to attend to,

70
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:41,480
so she begged Nanny Wu
to strike only our left hand.

71
00:04:41,870 --> 00:04:43,600
We needed the right hand
to keep working.

72
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:54,510
You're part of Luxue Lodge now.

73
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,160
You have to listen to me.

74
00:04:56,920 --> 00:05:00,240
You need to rest properly
for the next few days.

75
00:05:02,430 --> 00:05:04,360
You're so kind, Young Lady.

76
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,830
I was so confused

77
00:05:07,190 --> 00:05:08,830
that I nearly made a terrible mistake.

78
00:05:10,070 --> 00:05:12,190
Not only did you not scold me,

79
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,630
you've even treated me so kindly.

80
00:05:16,070 --> 00:05:19,190
This all started because of me.

81
00:05:20,390 --> 00:05:22,040
I wasn't careful enough that day.

82
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,040
I didn't check

83
00:05:24,070 --> 00:05:25,630
the festive ornament I gave Jinqi.

84
00:05:25,816 --> 00:05:28,600
That's why you got dragged into this
through no fault of your own.

85
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,240
Fortunately...

86
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:34,120
Her name is Lanxiang, right?

87
00:05:35,830 --> 00:05:36,390
Yes.

88
00:05:36,750 --> 00:05:37,560
Lanxiang.

89
00:05:40,824 --> 00:05:42,456
Fortunately, Lanxiang was quick-witted.

90
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:45,360
She knew to bring Nanny Wu
to get a flower ornament from you.

91
00:05:47,510 --> 00:05:48,310
But

92
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:51,480
how did Lanxiang know my given name?

93
00:05:56,390 --> 00:05:57,480
I did.

94
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:59,510
While we were chatting,

95
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,630
I just happened to mention it.

96
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:06,240
We're all girls.

97
00:06:06,536 --> 00:06:07,680
There's nothing shameful

98
00:06:07,750 --> 00:06:09,430
about my given name.

99
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:11,750
Good thing you did.

100
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:15,720
Here.

101
00:06:18,390 --> 00:06:19,120
Be careful.

102
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:23,480
Get some proper rest today.

103
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:26,560
When you're injured,
your vitality is weakened.

104
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:29,120
Sleep is the best remedy.

105
00:07:12,190 --> 00:07:12,950
Young Lady,

106
00:07:13,384 --> 00:07:14,630
what are you sighing about?

107
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:23,070
I was thinking of a story.

108
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,160
There's a line in it.

109
00:07:26,830 --> 00:07:28,360
This man is like a swift falcon.

110
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,680
If one strike is missed,

111
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:33,240
he soars away without looking back.

112
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:47,750
I long to be like that,

113
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:52,270
but all I can do

114
00:07:53,510 --> 00:07:55,480
is long for it.

115
00:08:14,390 --> 00:08:15,240
Granny Du.

116
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:18,190
Lanxiang only came home last night.

117
00:08:18,232 --> 00:08:20,450
It's rare for her to have
a day off from serving others.

118
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:22,800
I wanted to let her sleep in.

119
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:26,160
Now you're treating us like strangers.

120
00:08:27,070 --> 00:08:29,750
When Xiaolian's mother
came home from work,

121
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:32,030
you knew she was catching up on sleep,

122
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:34,790
so you always kept quiet
whatever you were doing.

123
00:08:35,510 --> 00:08:36,840
Thank you, Granny.

124
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:42,120
Keep it down.

125
00:08:42,390 --> 00:08:43,630
Gently.

126
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:47,030
Give it to me.

127
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,030
I'll do it.

128
00:08:51,272 --> 00:08:52,720
Once I've gathered the materials

129
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:54,070
and finished
Fourth Young Master's slingshot,

130
00:08:54,088 --> 00:08:55,640
I'll deliver it to the residence myself.

131
00:08:56,030 --> 00:08:57,240
Thank you.

132
00:09:01,670 --> 00:09:03,080
Gently.

133
00:09:06,390 --> 00:09:07,150
Take care.

134
00:09:35,140 --> 00:09:40,490
♪Time unfurls a long scroll♪

135
00:09:41,310 --> 00:09:46,280
♪Flowers bloom in
turn as twilight falls♪

136
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:52,790
♪Through rise and fall, people meet
and part as they always do♪

137
00:09:53,390 --> 00:09:58,990
♪Each plant endures its own trials
before reaching shore♪

138
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:02,420
♪Flowers drift with the ties of fate♪

139
00:10:02,620 --> 00:10:05,600
♪Plum blossoms bloom,
enduring the frost♪

140
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:08,950
♪Yet their proud spirit fades
with wind and snow♪

141
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:09,750
Father.

142
00:10:11,304 --> 00:10:12,200
You must be hungry.

143
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:13,120
Come eat.

144
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:15,630
It smells wonderful.

145
00:10:19,270 --> 00:10:20,440
There's something even better.

146
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:21,790
Here.

147
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,120
All right.

148
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:27,080
Try it.

149
00:10:27,100 --> 00:10:28,760
Put on some more
of the chilblain ointment

150
00:10:28,776 --> 00:10:29,592
I gave you yesterday.

151
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:31,000
I have to wash the dishes later.

152
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:31,720
After I'm done...

153
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:33,160
I'll wash the dishes after we eat.

154
00:10:34,270 --> 00:10:35,600
Go ahead and put it on.

155
00:10:35,910 --> 00:10:38,320
Otherwise, our daughter
won't be able to enjoy her meal.

156
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:40,600
All right, I'll put it on.

157
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:41,320
I'll put it on.

158
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:48,390
♪I read every joy
and sorrow behind the curtain♪

159
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:52,670
I can do it myself.

160
00:10:52,910 --> 00:10:53,870
I'll put it on for you.

161
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:02,120
Just use a little.

162
00:11:10,150 --> 00:11:10,960
You know,

163
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,670
this ointment Young Master gave you

164
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:14,510
really works wonders.

165
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:16,670
I put some on last night,

166
00:11:16,744 --> 00:11:17,670
and then went to sleep.

167
00:11:17,670 --> 00:11:18,360
Look.

168
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:20,720
See? It's gone down a lot.

169
00:11:20,720 --> 00:11:22,600
It doesn't look as red now.

170
00:11:24,150 --> 00:11:24,840
All right.

171
00:11:25,510 --> 00:11:26,320
Put it away.

172
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:30,510
All right, come on.

173
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:31,240
Let's eat.

174
00:11:32,472 --> 00:11:33,440
Here, have a big piece.

175
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:37,630
Here.

176
00:11:38,550 --> 00:11:39,360
Try this.

177
00:11:39,950 --> 00:11:42,230
♪Plum blossoms bloom,
enduring the frost♪

178
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:43,360
Here, have a lean piece.

179
00:11:44,390 --> 00:11:45,200
Try it.

180
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:50,910
It's delicious.

181
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,320
Have another if you like it.

182
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:55,050
♪Only orchids dwell in secluded places♪

183
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,200
It's so good.

184
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:57,192
The pork Mother made

185
00:11:57,272 --> 00:11:59,720
tastes even better than what the cooks
at the residence make.

186
00:12:02,056 --> 00:12:03,320
Why do you think Young Master

187
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:05,630
went out of his way
to give you a day off?

188
00:12:06,320 --> 00:12:07,510
Isn't it obvious?

189
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:09,790
Lanxiang must have
been clever and capable

190
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:10,910
and handled things well.

191
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:12,630
Young Master was pleased.

192
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:14,270
Father's right.

193
00:12:14,870 --> 00:12:17,270
Look how happy you two are.

194
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:18,000
You

195
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:19,270
are becoming just like

196
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:20,390
your father.

197
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:25,200
Eat.

198
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:25,630
Here.

199
00:12:25,630 --> 00:12:27,208
You should have more vegetables, too.

200
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:28,270
Here.

201
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:42,750
Come on.

202
00:12:42,870 --> 00:12:44,320
Have another lean piece.

203
00:12:45,910 --> 00:12:46,910
I'm already stuffed.

204
00:12:46,910 --> 00:12:48,120
I can't eat any more.

205
00:13:01,910 --> 00:13:04,120
I have something good to show you.

206
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:24,360
This silver ingot...

207
00:13:24,910 --> 00:13:26,550
Why are its color and size

208
00:13:28,030 --> 00:13:29,440
different from the others?

209
00:13:29,550 --> 00:13:30,200
This...

210
00:13:30,232 --> 00:13:31,270
This isn't a silver ingot.

211
00:13:31,270 --> 00:13:32,360
It's gold.

212
00:13:35,150 --> 00:13:36,240
It really is gold?

213
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:40,480
I've seen it at the shop.

214
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:41,480
This is gold.

215
00:13:41,670 --> 00:13:42,480
Bite it.

216
00:13:42,670 --> 00:13:44,120
It's different from silver.

217
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:50,390
Where did you get this?

218
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:54,790
I did something important.

219
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:58,030
You could say
I saved Young Master's marriage

220
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:59,390
and the Lin family's reputation.

221
00:13:59,672 --> 00:14:01,512
First Madam gave it
to me as a special reward.

222
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:04,390
Have you lost your senses?

223
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:08,720
Does Lanxiang look like someone
who'd do anything improper?

224
00:14:08,870 --> 00:14:10,840
Even if we did something underhanded,

225
00:14:10,904 --> 00:14:12,648
Lanxiang would never do such a thing.

226
00:14:13,270 --> 00:14:13,670
I...

227
00:14:17,630 --> 00:14:18,080
I...

228
00:14:18,510 --> 00:14:18,960
I was...

229
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:19,320
I was...

230
00:14:20,030 --> 00:14:21,080
I was just overwhelmed.

231
00:14:21,550 --> 00:14:22,870
Mother wasn't confused.

232
00:14:23,150 --> 00:14:25,000
The gold just left her stunned.

233
00:14:27,750 --> 00:14:28,200
This...

234
00:14:28,870 --> 00:14:29,440
This...

235
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:31,030
How much is this worth?

236
00:14:32,360 --> 00:14:34,030
A... A hundred taels?

237
00:14:34,030 --> 00:14:36,790
Even after the exchange fee,

238
00:14:37,120 --> 00:14:39,080
it should still be worth
seventy or eighty taels.

239
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:45,270
That's enough

240
00:14:45,390 --> 00:14:47,080
to buy freedom for all three of us.

241
00:14:48,270 --> 00:14:49,080
Really?

242
00:14:49,870 --> 00:14:51,080
Father's right.

243
00:14:51,510 --> 00:14:53,550
It is enough to buy our freedom.

244
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:57,080
Just think...

245
00:14:57,870 --> 00:14:58,670
Just think,

246
00:14:58,870 --> 00:15:00,030
after all these years,

247
00:15:00,030 --> 00:15:01,750
we've worked ourselves to the bone,

248
00:15:02,150 --> 00:15:03,750
yet we could never save much.

249
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:05,720
How...

250
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:08,030
How can we suddenly have enough?

251
00:15:11,870 --> 00:15:13,390
Then let's buy our freedom.

252
00:15:13,390 --> 00:15:14,200
Once we do,

253
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:15,960
Lanxiang won't even have to go back.

254
00:15:17,030 --> 00:15:18,240
I'll go find someone right now.

255
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:18,910
Father.

256
00:15:19,030 --> 00:15:19,630
Father.

257
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:20,390
Father.

258
00:15:23,150 --> 00:15:23,960
Mother.

259
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:26,480
The time isn't right
to buy our freedom yet.

260
00:15:28,630 --> 00:15:28,960
What...

261
00:15:29,080 --> 00:15:30,030
What do you mean?

262
00:15:30,184 --> 00:15:31,870
Didn't we say once we had enough money,

263
00:15:31,896 --> 00:15:33,860
the three of us could
leave the household registry

264
00:15:33,870 --> 00:15:35,000
and buy our freedom together?

265
00:15:35,870 --> 00:15:37,960
I was thinking too simply before.

266
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:39,390
At the going rate,

267
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:41,720
buying freedom for the three of us

268
00:15:41,870 --> 00:15:43,750
would cost no more
than several dozen taels.

269
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:46,600
But do Old Master and First Madam

270
00:15:46,840 --> 00:15:48,960
really care about
a few dozen taels of silver?

271
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:55,600
That amount of money

272
00:15:57,270 --> 00:15:59,550
means nothing at all

273
00:15:59,790 --> 00:16:01,360
to them.

274
00:16:03,870 --> 00:16:05,480
The key to buying our freedom

275
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:06,630
isn't money.

276
00:16:07,440 --> 00:16:08,870
It's First Madam's willingness.

277
00:16:10,390 --> 00:16:11,870
First Madam's willingness?

278
00:16:16,480 --> 00:16:18,390
We can't see it or touch it.

279
00:16:18,870 --> 00:16:19,910
It's not like money

280
00:16:20,150 --> 00:16:21,270
that we can go out and earn.

281
00:16:22,320 --> 00:16:23,510
We can't rush this.

282
00:16:24,056 --> 00:16:25,630
We must plan carefully before we act

283
00:16:26,080 --> 00:16:28,480
and wait for the right moment
to make our move.

284
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:32,670
When that time comes, the three of us

285
00:16:32,670 --> 00:16:34,150
will surely be freed from servitude

286
00:16:34,480 --> 00:16:35,670
and become commoners.

287
00:16:37,670 --> 00:16:39,360
Lanxiang has grown up.

288
00:16:39,870 --> 00:16:42,390
You think everything through now.

289
00:16:43,270 --> 00:16:45,390
Your mother and I will follow your lead.

290
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:49,120
Keep the gold safe.

291
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:52,080
Once we leave Lin Residence,

292
00:16:52,240 --> 00:16:54,120
it'll give us the means to find a home,

293
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:56,200
build a life, and start over.

294
00:17:30,968 --> 00:17:32,680
It took me forever to send the maids

295
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:34,160
and the gatekeeper away.

296
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:36,480
Don't make a sound later.

297
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:53,030
Please, Xiuru.

298
00:17:53,070 --> 00:17:55,160
Come listen with me
about Xiuwan's marriage.

299
00:17:56,270 --> 00:17:57,070
Come on.

300
00:18:01,480 --> 00:18:03,590
Xiuwan's marriage to the Xie family

301
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:04,960
is settled, isn't it?

302
00:18:05,830 --> 00:18:08,510
Ever since they met
on the Festival of Man,

303
00:18:08,510 --> 00:18:10,880
Xie Zhao has been very pleased

304
00:18:10,880 --> 00:18:11,750
with our Lin family.

305
00:18:11,960 --> 00:18:12,640
And Xiuwan

306
00:18:12,790 --> 00:18:14,240
is also pleased with Xie Zhao.

307
00:18:14,960 --> 00:18:16,070
Whenever I ask her about it,

308
00:18:16,270 --> 00:18:18,200
she just blushes and smiles.

309
00:18:20,600 --> 00:18:22,152
I'm discussing with the matchmaker

310
00:18:22,184 --> 00:18:24,110
an auspicious date
for the betrothal gifts.

311
00:18:24,720 --> 00:18:28,270
The marriage proposal, betrothal gifts,
bride-price, then the wedding.

312
00:18:30,680 --> 00:18:31,400
Who knows?

313
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:33,240
Xiuwan may
be married off this very year.

314
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:34,590
Most likely.

315
00:18:35,070 --> 00:18:37,160
I think at the latest,

316
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:38,750
it'll be in the first half of next year.

317
00:18:38,750 --> 00:18:39,880
The first half?

318
00:18:40,110 --> 00:18:40,960
So soon?

319
00:18:42,830 --> 00:18:44,790
I can't believe Xiuwan's marriage

320
00:18:44,790 --> 00:18:45,590
is really settled.

321
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:49,310
I'm both happy and sad.

322
00:18:50,240 --> 00:18:51,750
That's what it's like being a mother.

323
00:18:52,270 --> 00:18:53,830
When there's no marriage in sight,

324
00:18:53,880 --> 00:18:55,270
you're beside yourself with worry.

325
00:18:55,960 --> 00:18:57,350
Once a match is settled,

326
00:18:57,550 --> 00:18:59,750
you still can't stop worrying,

327
00:19:00,790 --> 00:19:02,920
wondering what their
married life will be like.

328
00:19:04,590 --> 00:19:05,400
Shunhua,

329
00:19:05,750 --> 00:19:06,830
you don't need to worry

330
00:19:06,830 --> 00:19:08,110
about Jinqi's marriage, either.

331
00:19:08,270 --> 00:19:09,110
Our Jinqi

332
00:19:09,310 --> 00:19:11,440
stands out in character,

333
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:12,920
looks, and ability.

334
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:14,350
At such a young age,

335
00:19:14,350 --> 00:19:16,960
he's already a Fourth-Rank
assistant commander.

336
00:19:17,550 --> 00:19:19,480
Even though Zhao
delayed him for several years,

337
00:19:19,680 --> 00:19:20,960
it won't hold him back.

338
00:19:21,310 --> 00:19:22,110
We'll certainly

339
00:19:22,350 --> 00:19:24,240
find him an excellent match.

340
00:19:25,256 --> 00:19:27,350
Why are you standing outside
instead of going in?

341
00:19:38,440 --> 00:19:39,750
It's almost the second month,

342
00:19:39,848 --> 00:19:42,088
but there's been
a cold snap these past few days.

343
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:43,590
Don't catch a chill.

344
00:19:48,328 --> 00:19:49,990
First Madam
wants you all to come inside.

345
00:19:50,050 --> 00:19:51,288
Be careful not to catch a cold.

346
00:19:51,350 --> 00:19:53,240
We thought Jinqi was inside,

347
00:19:53,550 --> 00:19:55,960
so we wanted to hide beneath the window

348
00:19:55,960 --> 00:19:57,000
and give him a scare.

349
00:19:57,768 --> 00:19:59,510
My brother came over early this morning

350
00:19:59,510 --> 00:20:00,550
in a great hurry.

351
00:20:00,616 --> 00:20:02,880
He said there was an urgent matter
at the military camp,

352
00:20:02,960 --> 00:20:05,200
and then took Jinqi with him.

353
00:20:10,110 --> 00:20:11,110
I'd say

354
00:20:11,160 --> 00:20:13,032
it'll be quite
a while before they return.

355
00:20:20,830 --> 00:20:21,270
Come out!

356
00:20:21,270 --> 00:20:22,480
- Lin Jinqi, come out!
- Lin Jinqi, come out!

357
00:20:22,510 --> 00:20:23,980
(Jinling Shence Garrison)
Lin Jinqi, come out!

358
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:27,480
Back up!

359
00:20:27,750 --> 00:20:28,640
Back up!

360
00:20:28,640 --> 00:20:29,440
Go back at once!

361
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:30,640
Back up now!

362
00:20:30,640 --> 00:20:31,590
Don't cause trouble!

363
00:20:31,590 --> 00:20:32,720
Cause trouble?

364
00:20:32,808 --> 00:20:35,192
Do you all want a beating
with military rods?

365
00:20:37,336 --> 00:20:38,248
(Sun Yong, Chief Banner Officer)

366
00:20:38,320 --> 00:20:40,744
(of the Shence Garrison)
Tell that heartless Lin Jinqi to come!

367
00:20:40,960 --> 00:20:42,960
He must give us an explanation today!

368
00:20:43,110 --> 00:20:44,730
Our fellow soldiers were alive and well.

369
00:20:44,750 --> 00:20:46,550
They can't just die
without us knowing why!

370
00:20:46,584 --> 00:20:47,160
That's right!

371
00:20:47,160 --> 00:20:50,510
- Punish Lin Jinqi severely!
- Punish Lin Jinqi severely!

372
00:20:50,720 --> 00:20:52,830
If we don't get
a clear explanation today,

373
00:20:53,070 --> 00:20:55,160
Lin Jinqi won't leave here alive!

374
00:20:55,224 --> 00:20:56,510
- That's right!
- That's right!

375
00:20:59,860 --> 00:21:01,128
Before the Chinese New Year,

376
00:21:01,176 --> 00:21:03,390
when the soldiers
received the padded coats you issued,

377
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:05,100
some already felt
they weren't warm enough.

378
00:21:05,960 --> 00:21:07,960
Then this recent cold snap hit,
and soldiers

379
00:21:08,024 --> 00:21:09,480
(Liang Yu)
at the military camp began falling ill

380
00:21:09,550 --> 00:21:11,630
(Third-Rank Commander)
with colds one after another.

381
00:21:11,720 --> 00:21:13,496
(of the Shence Garrison)
Some even died.

382
00:21:13,576 --> 00:21:14,824
Only then did we discover

383
00:21:15,070 --> 00:21:16,510
that the padded coats were filled

384
00:21:16,640 --> 00:21:18,960
entirely with old, moldy cotton,
and some

385
00:21:19,096 --> 00:21:21,848
were even stuffed with reed fluff
that provided no warmth at all.

386
00:21:22,590 --> 00:21:23,350
After inspection,

387
00:21:24,640 --> 00:21:27,880
four or five out
of every ten were like this.

388
00:21:28,984 --> 00:21:32,056
When we first received the padded coats
from the Ministry of Revenue,

389
00:21:33,070 --> 00:21:34,480
I had people inspect samples.

390
00:21:35,352 --> 00:21:37,624
Every one they checked
contained high-quality cotton.

391
00:21:40,400 --> 00:21:41,200
I never expected

392
00:21:42,160 --> 00:21:44,070
so many inferior ones to be mixed in.

393
00:21:47,830 --> 00:21:48,960
I failed in my duty.

394
00:21:49,384 --> 00:21:51,480
There were five
or six thousand padded coats.

395
00:21:51,640 --> 00:21:54,232
You couldn't possibly have cut
every one open to inspect it.

396
00:21:55,830 --> 00:21:57,310
I know you're innocent.

397
00:21:58,790 --> 00:22:00,160
But rumors are spreading

398
00:22:02,552 --> 00:22:05,310
that you colluded with unscrupulous
merchants and took bribes,

399
00:22:05,416 --> 00:22:07,880
passing off inferior goods
as quality ones and causing deaths.

400
00:22:08,830 --> 00:22:09,590
This matter

401
00:22:09,830 --> 00:22:12,790
was handled by you
from beginning to end.

402
00:22:14,750 --> 00:22:16,880
The higher-ups wanted
to punish you severely.

403
00:22:17,440 --> 00:22:18,640
I argued your case,

404
00:22:19,240 --> 00:22:21,510
and managed to stop them
from convicting you outright.

405
00:22:21,688 --> 00:22:23,912
For now, you've only
been suspended from duty.

406
00:22:26,030 --> 00:22:26,960
Thank you, Commander.

407
00:22:28,920 --> 00:22:30,184
You heard them outside.

408
00:22:31,350 --> 00:22:32,640
Go home and lie low for now.

409
00:22:32,792 --> 00:22:34,728
I've already ordered
a thorough investigation.

410
00:22:35,590 --> 00:22:36,720
I will clear your name.

411
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:41,880
I'll take my leave.

412
00:22:47,200 --> 00:22:48,000
Back!

413
00:22:48,590 --> 00:22:49,480
Everyone, back!

414
00:22:52,680 --> 00:22:53,550
Everyone, back!

415
00:22:56,640 --> 00:22:58,160
Or you'll be killed on the spot!

416
00:23:16,720 --> 00:23:17,510
Lin Jinqi.

417
00:23:19,750 --> 00:23:22,550
This is the padded coat
you issued us to keep out the cold.

418
00:23:24,550 --> 00:23:25,750
Two of our fellow soldiers

419
00:23:26,880 --> 00:23:29,030
caught a cold and died.

420
00:23:30,350 --> 00:23:32,110
As men,

421
00:23:32,750 --> 00:23:34,920
even if we die on the battlefield,

422
00:23:35,510 --> 00:23:37,160
we'd be giving
our lives for our country!

423
00:23:39,310 --> 00:23:40,480
But they

424
00:23:41,510 --> 00:23:44,960
fell ill from the cold and died
in their own barracks!

425
00:23:58,480 --> 00:24:00,350
You high-ranking officials

426
00:24:01,270 --> 00:24:03,070
are truly heartless.

427
00:24:04,310 --> 00:24:06,400
You wear your fur coats,

428
00:24:07,550 --> 00:24:09,310
yet you even embezzle and skimp on

429
00:24:09,350 --> 00:24:10,720
the padded coats issued to us!

430
00:24:15,070 --> 00:24:16,000
Back!

431
00:24:16,830 --> 00:24:18,000
Everyone, back!

432
00:24:31,070 --> 00:24:31,960
Brothers,

433
00:24:33,720 --> 00:24:34,510
I, Lin Jinqi,

434
00:24:35,480 --> 00:24:37,200
have also been wounded
on the battlefield,

435
00:24:38,400 --> 00:24:39,350
shed blood,

436
00:24:40,720 --> 00:24:41,720
saved my brothers,

437
00:24:43,310 --> 00:24:44,400
and been saved by them.

438
00:24:45,720 --> 00:24:46,440
Here.

439
00:24:48,000 --> 00:24:48,790
Here!

440
00:24:50,480 --> 00:24:52,070
I was slashed by the Wo pirates.

441
00:24:56,880 --> 00:24:57,790
And here,

442
00:24:58,840 --> 00:25:01,048
I was struck
by a Wo pirate's blade, too!

443
00:25:07,510 --> 00:25:09,590
If not for the brothers
who fought beside me,

444
00:25:11,350 --> 00:25:12,550
I, Lin Jinqi,

445
00:25:13,680 --> 00:25:15,510
would have long
since been nothing but bones.

446
00:25:16,640 --> 00:25:18,968
What I despise most
are those who betray their brothers

447
00:25:19,720 --> 00:25:21,350
and stab them in the back!

448
00:25:23,240 --> 00:25:24,400
Your grief

449
00:25:25,640 --> 00:25:26,400
and anger,

450
00:25:28,480 --> 00:25:30,030
I feel them as deeply as you do.

451
00:25:35,720 --> 00:25:37,110
With Heaven above

452
00:25:38,400 --> 00:25:39,680
and Earth below as my witnesses,

453
00:25:41,110 --> 00:25:44,030
I, Lin Jinqi, will never let this matter

454
00:25:44,200 --> 00:25:45,790
pass without the truth coming to light!

455
00:25:47,000 --> 00:25:48,550
I will give everyone

456
00:25:48,790 --> 00:25:50,550
a full and clear explanation!

457
00:25:51,880 --> 00:25:52,790
Otherwise,

458
00:25:54,750 --> 00:25:56,830
may I die beneath a hail of blades

459
00:25:57,880 --> 00:25:59,310
and meet a terrible end.

460
00:26:08,440 --> 00:26:15,120
♪Every word carries countless thoughts♪

461
00:26:15,980 --> 00:26:18,800
♪The encounters of half a lifetime♪

462
00:26:20,400 --> 00:26:21,480
Lin Jinqi.

463
00:26:25,310 --> 00:26:27,070
We'll be waiting for your explanation.

464
00:26:27,736 --> 00:26:29,496
Otherwise, we won't
need Heaven to do it.

465
00:26:30,160 --> 00:26:32,550
We'll cut you down ourselves!

466
00:26:32,920 --> 00:26:34,110
Cut him down!

467
00:26:36,640 --> 00:26:37,880
May you die a terrible death!

468
00:26:37,880 --> 00:26:39,352
Pay with your life for our brothers!

469
00:26:39,450 --> 00:26:43,060
♪With my own hands and heart♪

470
00:26:43,110 --> 00:26:44,200
Are you even human?

471
00:26:44,280 --> 00:26:45,450
May you die a terrible death!

472
00:26:47,400 --> 00:26:57,350
♪Through countless lines of ink,
I question the past♪

473
00:27:05,528 --> 00:27:06,750
We're getting off early today.

474
00:27:06,888 --> 00:27:08,872
Let's go to Liufeng House
for a couple of drinks.

475
00:27:09,200 --> 00:27:09,880
Sounds good.

476
00:27:10,790 --> 00:27:11,440
Let's go.

477
00:27:25,240 --> 00:27:27,030
Lin Jinqi, what are you trying to do?

478
00:27:32,110 --> 00:27:35,510
The padded coats issued to Shence
Garrison before the Chinese New Year.

479
00:27:36,400 --> 00:27:37,310
These padded coats

480
00:27:38,400 --> 00:27:40,000
have already cost two men their lives.

481
00:27:42,400 --> 00:27:43,200
Registrar Dai,

482
00:27:44,350 --> 00:27:45,400
I want an explanation.

483
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:52,200
Fengtai,

484
00:27:53,310 --> 00:27:55,640
I explained everything
clearly to you back then.

485
00:27:55,960 --> 00:27:57,440
It had been snowing heavily for days.

486
00:27:57,816 --> 00:28:00,640
The winter clothing granted
by the court was held up on the road

487
00:28:00,904 --> 00:28:02,070
and couldn't get through.

488
00:28:02,960 --> 00:28:04,310
But you couldn't wait.

489
00:28:06,030 --> 00:28:07,030
I had no choice

490
00:28:07,310 --> 00:28:08,550
but to ask around everywhere.

491
00:28:09,480 --> 00:28:10,750
After much persuasion,

492
00:28:11,110 --> 00:28:11,960
I finally found

493
00:28:11,960 --> 00:28:13,550
a merchant willing to supply the goods.

494
00:28:14,110 --> 00:28:14,960
All our colleagues

495
00:28:15,440 --> 00:28:17,480
can vouch for me on this.

496
00:28:17,790 --> 00:28:18,440
Yes.

497
00:28:18,680 --> 00:28:19,640
We can vouch for him.

498
00:28:19,640 --> 00:28:20,904
That's exactly what happened.

499
00:28:21,480 --> 00:28:23,270
You met that merchant,

500
00:28:23,480 --> 00:28:24,790
Lu Dalang, yourself.

501
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:28,550
You also agreed to the arrangement.

502
00:28:29,030 --> 00:28:30,200
After the goods arrived,

503
00:28:30,200 --> 00:28:32,690
the Ministry of Revenue
inspected them according to procedure.

504
00:28:33,160 --> 00:28:35,030
From inspection to storage

505
00:28:35,096 --> 00:28:36,408
and then to release from storage,

506
00:28:36,590 --> 00:28:38,510
each step was signed and recorded.

507
00:28:40,312 --> 00:28:42,030
The account books can verify everything.

508
00:28:42,904 --> 00:28:45,736
(Released from Warehouse Yi Today)
When that batch of padded coats left,

509
00:28:45,784 --> 00:28:47,180
they all met the required standards.

510
00:28:47,200 --> 00:28:48,990
(Lin Jinqi, Assistant Commander)
So why did they turn into

511
00:28:49,032 --> 00:28:51,336
inferior padded coats
after reaching the Shence Garrison?

512
00:28:51,680 --> 00:28:55,310
Fengtai, you'd better
investigate this thoroughly.

513
00:28:59,350 --> 00:29:01,440
I won't just investigate this matter.

514
00:29:03,000 --> 00:29:04,750
I'll get to the bottom of it

515
00:29:05,550 --> 00:29:07,400
and find out exactly

516
00:29:08,200 --> 00:29:09,550
what happened.

517
00:29:10,880 --> 00:29:12,030
No matter who it was,

518
00:29:14,000 --> 00:29:15,400
if they had a hand in this,

519
00:29:16,070 --> 00:29:17,240
they won't get away.

520
00:29:20,808 --> 00:29:21,784
I went to the residence

521
00:29:21,832 --> 00:29:23,590
of that merchant, Lu Dalang,
to investigate.

522
00:29:23,600 --> 00:29:26,190
Lu Dalang's home caught fire
during Chinese New Year's firecrackers.

523
00:29:26,200 --> 00:29:28,890
Fortunately, it was put out in time
and didn't spread to the neighbors.

524
00:29:29,200 --> 00:29:30,030
After the fire,

525
00:29:30,040 --> 00:29:32,020
Lu Dalang said
he was going to stay with relatives

526
00:29:32,030 --> 00:29:33,400
and left Jinling with his family.

527
00:29:33,400 --> 00:29:34,990
No one has known his whereabouts since.

528
00:29:35,310 --> 00:29:37,110
More than twenty days have passed now.

529
00:29:37,640 --> 00:29:38,830
Finding him again

530
00:29:39,256 --> 00:29:40,536
will probably take some effort.

531
00:29:43,200 --> 00:29:44,200
What a coincidence.

532
00:29:45,680 --> 00:29:46,830
He just happened to leave.

533
00:29:55,580 --> 00:29:57,660
(Ten Days Later)

534
00:30:02,270 --> 00:30:03,350
Leave this side to me.

535
00:30:03,440 --> 00:30:04,310
You go over there.

536
00:30:21,200 --> 00:30:21,720
Young Master.

537
00:30:22,110 --> 00:30:23,070
Young Lady Du is here.

538
00:30:31,350 --> 00:30:32,110
Jinqi.

539
00:30:34,960 --> 00:30:37,440
Are you playing against yourself?

540
00:30:39,336 --> 00:30:40,510
I had nothing else to do,

541
00:30:40,632 --> 00:30:41,896
so I'm just passing the time.

542
00:30:43,680 --> 00:30:44,920
I have nothing to do, either.

543
00:30:45,400 --> 00:30:46,880
If you don't mind, Jinqi,

544
00:30:47,160 --> 00:30:49,720
why don't I play a game with you?

545
00:31:01,512 --> 00:31:03,200
You're an excellent player, Cuique.

546
00:31:03,960 --> 00:31:06,480
But I've been playing
for quite a while today.

547
00:31:06,750 --> 00:31:07,830
I'm feeling a little tired

548
00:31:07,960 --> 00:31:08,880
and would like to rest.

549
00:31:09,480 --> 00:31:10,270
Maybe next time.

550
00:31:14,200 --> 00:31:17,000
Are you upset
about being suspended, Jinqi?

551
00:31:20,264 --> 00:31:23,000
My brother told me what happened
with the Shence Garrison.

552
00:31:24,350 --> 00:31:27,590
I firmly believe you're innocent, Jinqi.

553
00:31:28,880 --> 00:31:30,310
No matter how others see you,

554
00:31:30,310 --> 00:31:32,568
what they say about you,
or how they slander you, I...

555
00:31:37,030 --> 00:31:37,790
My brother and I

556
00:31:38,200 --> 00:31:39,510
both believe in you, Jinqi.

557
00:31:41,030 --> 00:31:43,110
The truth will surely come to light

558
00:31:43,270 --> 00:31:44,600
and everything will be made clear.

559
00:31:48,070 --> 00:31:50,640
I also believe
the truth will come to light

560
00:31:50,712 --> 00:31:52,200
and everything will be made clear.

561
00:31:54,000 --> 00:31:55,440
Did you come to see me today

562
00:31:56,110 --> 00:31:57,240
for something in particular?

563
00:32:03,590 --> 00:32:04,920
I was just a little worried,

564
00:32:05,400 --> 00:32:06,590
so I came to see you.

565
00:32:07,000 --> 00:32:09,070
I thought if something
was troubling you,

566
00:32:09,200 --> 00:32:11,110
I could keep you company
and talk with you.

567
00:32:16,400 --> 00:32:17,400
Since you're tired,

568
00:32:17,750 --> 00:32:18,880
you should get some rest.

569
00:32:19,550 --> 00:32:21,070
I won't disturb you any longer.

570
00:32:21,160 --> 00:32:21,920
I'll be going now.

571
00:32:22,440 --> 00:32:23,440
Take care, Cuique.

572
00:32:50,350 --> 00:32:51,200
Aunt Lingxiao.

573
00:32:54,310 --> 00:32:55,160
Young Lady Du.

574
00:32:55,400 --> 00:32:56,440
Jinqi.

575
00:32:57,270 --> 00:32:58,440
Jinqi.

576
00:33:03,960 --> 00:33:04,550
Xiaolian,

577
00:33:07,070 --> 00:33:08,160
you don't come by often.

578
00:33:08,440 --> 00:33:09,920
Go spend some time with the girls.

579
00:33:10,160 --> 00:33:11,440
I can go back by myself.

580
00:33:13,400 --> 00:33:14,270
Thank you, Young Lady.

581
00:33:17,400 --> 00:33:18,200
Jinqi,

582
00:33:18,880 --> 00:33:20,640
you have to help Xiuwan.

583
00:33:21,640 --> 00:33:23,270
If word of this gets out,

584
00:33:23,480 --> 00:33:25,720
how is she supposed
to face people in the future?

585
00:33:27,350 --> 00:33:27,960
Aunt Lingxiao,

586
00:33:28,160 --> 00:33:29,160
don't worry just yet.

587
00:33:29,270 --> 00:33:30,408
Sit down and tell me slowly.

588
00:33:30,510 --> 00:33:31,680
What exactly happened?

589
00:33:33,440 --> 00:33:35,350
Xiuwan's marriage to the Xie family

590
00:33:36,110 --> 00:33:38,000
was practically settled.

591
00:33:38,010 --> 00:33:40,120
But the Xie family
has suddenly changed their minds,

592
00:33:40,136 --> 00:33:41,896
claiming their
birth dates are incompatible.

593
00:33:42,070 --> 00:33:43,440
If word gets out,

594
00:33:43,960 --> 00:33:45,270
people will think our Xiuwan

595
00:33:45,270 --> 00:33:46,790
has something wrong with her.

596
00:33:48,590 --> 00:33:49,270
Aunt Lingxiao,

597
00:33:49,848 --> 00:33:50,510
the Xie...

598
00:33:50,510 --> 00:33:51,480
Jinqi,

599
00:33:52,110 --> 00:33:53,160
your second uncle

600
00:33:54,240 --> 00:33:56,856
spends his days following
Taoist priests and drawing talismans.

601
00:33:57,030 --> 00:33:58,510
He's not someone we can rely on.

602
00:33:58,880 --> 00:34:00,070
Since you happen to be free,

603
00:34:00,680 --> 00:34:02,200
hurry over to the Xie family

604
00:34:02,550 --> 00:34:03,270
and find out

605
00:34:03,270 --> 00:34:04,680
what exactly is going on.

606
00:34:04,680 --> 00:34:07,048
Why would a perfectly
good marriage suddenly fall through?

607
00:34:07,270 --> 00:34:08,360
What exactly is

608
00:34:08,670 --> 00:34:10,510
wrong with our Xiuwan?

609
00:34:13,070 --> 00:34:13,880
Aunt Lingxiao,

610
00:34:14,536 --> 00:34:16,456
the Xie family
doesn't want this marriage

611
00:34:16,472 --> 00:34:18,440
not because there's
anything wrong with Xiuwan.

612
00:34:18,760 --> 00:34:19,630
It's because of me.

613
00:34:21,110 --> 00:34:22,320
I've dragged Xiuwan into this.

614
00:34:23,190 --> 00:34:23,480
You...

615
00:34:24,710 --> 00:34:26,590
What do you mean by that?

616
00:34:28,760 --> 00:34:29,710
First Madam.

617
00:34:33,760 --> 00:34:34,510
Shunhua.

618
00:34:35,360 --> 00:34:36,400
Xiuwan...

619
00:34:40,440 --> 00:34:41,360
There's something

620
00:34:41,630 --> 00:34:43,336
I haven't had a chance to tell you yet.

621
00:34:44,030 --> 00:34:44,510
Come.

622
00:34:46,456 --> 00:34:48,360
Something happened
at the Shence Garrison.

623
00:34:48,960 --> 00:34:51,710
Jinqi was falsely accused
of taking bribes,

624
00:34:51,800 --> 00:34:53,272
and shortchanging the soldiers.

625
00:34:53,360 --> 00:34:55,352
He's already
been suspended by his superior.

626
00:34:56,550 --> 00:34:59,630
And with his previous separation
from the Zhao family,

627
00:34:59,920 --> 00:35:01,000
I've been thinking

628
00:35:01,630 --> 00:35:04,190
the Xie family only backed out

629
00:35:04,280 --> 00:35:06,280
because our family ran into trouble.

630
00:35:08,630 --> 00:35:09,440
So

631
00:35:09,840 --> 00:35:11,000
the Xie family

632
00:35:11,960 --> 00:35:14,440
believes Jinqi will
be suppressed by the Zhao family

633
00:35:14,710 --> 00:35:16,840
and never rise again.

634
00:35:16,984 --> 00:35:18,888
That's why they're using the birth dates

635
00:35:19,230 --> 00:35:21,000
to find fault with Xiuwan?

636
00:35:22,760 --> 00:35:24,030
That must be it.

637
00:35:28,070 --> 00:35:29,400
I've dragged Xiuwan into this.

638
00:35:34,184 --> 00:35:36,030
And the Xie family
is always claiming to be

639
00:35:36,030 --> 00:35:37,190
a distinguished family?

640
00:35:38,440 --> 00:35:39,230
As if!

641
00:35:42,590 --> 00:35:43,480
Jinqi,

642
00:35:44,000 --> 00:35:45,670
none of this is your fault.

643
00:35:46,840 --> 00:35:48,480
Think about it. In a person's lifetime,

644
00:35:48,936 --> 00:35:50,760
how could everything
possibly go smoothly

645
00:35:50,760 --> 00:35:52,150
without any setbacks?

646
00:35:53,480 --> 00:35:55,960
The Xie family is so eager
to curry favor with the powerful.

647
00:35:57,760 --> 00:36:00,030
If I really married
Xiuwan into their family,

648
00:36:02,920 --> 00:36:05,550
wouldn't I be pushing her
into a living hell?

649
00:36:10,190 --> 00:36:12,760
Those snobs who look down on others.

650
00:36:15,320 --> 00:36:16,920
If they don't want this marriage,

651
00:36:18,024 --> 00:36:20,000
then we won't marry
into their family either.

652
00:36:20,760 --> 00:36:21,840
We won't!

653
00:36:24,264 --> 00:36:25,510
Don't worry, Aunt Lingxiao.

654
00:36:26,190 --> 00:36:27,510
I'll visit the Xie family shortly

655
00:36:27,800 --> 00:36:29,280
and make things clear with them.

656
00:36:29,550 --> 00:36:31,320
I won't let a single disparaging word

657
00:36:31,360 --> 00:36:32,264
be said about Xiuwan.

658
00:36:35,400 --> 00:36:36,320
You unfilial son!

659
00:36:37,710 --> 00:36:40,150
You wretched fool!
You've caused such a huge mess,

660
00:36:40,150 --> 00:36:42,190
yet you're hiding at home
as if nothing happened!

661
00:36:42,584 --> 00:36:44,070
Instead of going around seeking help,

662
00:36:44,070 --> 00:36:46,380
asking people to use
their connections and plead your case,

663
00:36:46,392 --> 00:36:48,150
you still have the leisure
to play chess!

664
00:36:48,710 --> 00:36:49,400
Changzheng.

665
00:36:51,280 --> 00:36:53,000
Jinqi has a plan of his own.

666
00:36:53,190 --> 00:36:54,590
We don't need to worry about him.

667
00:36:55,000 --> 00:36:56,150
A plan?

668
00:36:57,576 --> 00:36:58,808
Would someone with a plan

669
00:36:59,320 --> 00:37:00,880
have offended the Zhao family?

670
00:37:01,280 --> 00:37:03,230
I told you not to separate from Zhao,

671
00:37:03,230 --> 00:37:04,330
but you refused to listen.

672
00:37:04,340 --> 00:37:05,150
And look at you now.

673
00:37:05,360 --> 00:37:06,664
The moment something happened,

674
00:37:06,670 --> 00:37:08,070
your superior suspended you.

675
00:37:08,110 --> 00:37:08,880
Mark my words.

676
00:37:08,880 --> 00:37:09,710
Within days,

677
00:37:09,800 --> 00:37:11,336
you'll be dismissed and investigated,

678
00:37:11,360 --> 00:37:12,520
and then thrown in prison!

679
00:37:12,590 --> 00:37:14,110
What nonsense are you talking about?

680
00:37:14,920 --> 00:37:16,280
Jinqi was falsely accused.

681
00:37:16,440 --> 00:37:18,330
He didn't embezzle anything
or take any bribes.

682
00:37:18,440 --> 00:37:20,744
How could he possibly
be dismissed and imprisoned?

683
00:37:21,030 --> 00:37:23,550
You've offended Grand Secretary Zhao.

684
00:37:23,630 --> 00:37:26,030
Do you think they care
whether you're innocent?

685
00:37:26,728 --> 00:37:28,990
Do you think he became
a Fourth-Rank assistant commander

686
00:37:29,000 --> 00:37:30,230
because he's so capable?

687
00:37:30,344 --> 00:37:32,670
It's because he's
the Grand Secretary's grandson-in-law.

688
00:37:32,670 --> 00:37:34,232
He had someone powerful backing him!

689
00:37:35,320 --> 00:37:36,510
Now Grand Secretary Zhao

690
00:37:36,760 --> 00:37:39,710
is on the verge
of becoming Grand Secretary-in-Chief,

691
00:37:40,110 --> 00:37:43,510
yet he's parted ways
with the Zhao family.

692
00:37:43,670 --> 00:37:46,710
He's practically asking for trouble.

693
00:37:46,840 --> 00:37:48,920
If they don't frame him,
who else would they frame?

694
00:37:49,030 --> 00:37:50,150
As I see it,

695
00:37:50,480 --> 00:37:52,230
he should just wait
to be thrown in prison.

696
00:37:53,230 --> 00:37:54,280
Lin Changzheng!

697
00:37:54,400 --> 00:37:56,110
You truly are a vulgar man.

698
00:37:58,150 --> 00:38:01,510
Utterly vulgar and thoroughly repulsive.

699
00:38:01,510 --> 00:38:03,380
(Lin Changmin, Lin Jinqi's Second Uncle)

700
00:38:04,880 --> 00:38:05,800
Lin Changmin.

701
00:38:06,840 --> 00:38:09,480
Who are you calling utterly vulgar
and thoroughly repulsive?

702
00:38:09,670 --> 00:38:10,480
You.

703
00:38:11,230 --> 00:38:12,030
Changzheng,

704
00:38:12,400 --> 00:38:14,280
you've studied for decades,

705
00:38:14,400 --> 00:38:16,480
yet all you think
about is rank and wealth.

706
00:38:16,584 --> 00:38:18,870
You spend every day scheming
and scrambling for advantage,

707
00:38:18,880 --> 00:38:21,000
thinking only of how to flatter

708
00:38:21,000 --> 00:38:22,840
those high-ranking officials.

709
00:38:24,670 --> 00:38:25,480
Changzheng,

710
00:38:25,592 --> 00:38:27,400
since you admire
Grand Secretary Zhao so much,

711
00:38:27,590 --> 00:38:29,230
why make your own son

712
00:38:29,230 --> 00:38:30,960
the Grand Secretary's grandson-in-law?

713
00:38:31,400 --> 00:38:33,510
Why don't you
become his son-in-law yourself?

714
00:38:35,000 --> 00:38:35,710
Changmin!

715
00:38:35,880 --> 00:38:37,590
I've put up with you for long enough.

716
00:38:37,960 --> 00:38:39,280
No one stops me today!

717
00:38:39,440 --> 00:38:40,320
No one stops me!

718
00:38:40,670 --> 00:38:42,480
I'm going to settle this with you!

719
00:38:42,880 --> 00:38:44,000
Changzheng, wait.

720
00:38:46,190 --> 00:38:48,110
You said you've put up
with me for a long time?

721
00:38:48,360 --> 00:38:49,030
That's right!

722
00:38:49,432 --> 00:38:51,280
I cultivate my mind
and character every day,

723
00:38:51,280 --> 00:38:52,270
meditating on the Taoist,

724
00:38:52,280 --> 00:38:55,030
and I've long since risen
above this mundane world.

725
00:38:55,590 --> 00:38:56,760
I would never

726
00:38:56,760 --> 00:38:58,510
associate with a vulgar man like you.

727
00:38:58,616 --> 00:38:59,920
When have I ever provoked him?

728
00:38:59,920 --> 00:39:01,550
Have I ever provoked him? Unbelievable.

729
00:39:02,824 --> 00:39:04,400
If I don't teach you a lesson today,

730
00:39:04,400 --> 00:39:05,320
I'm not your brother!

731
00:39:05,480 --> 00:39:05,840
I...

732
00:39:06,150 --> 00:39:06,670
I...

733
00:39:07,896 --> 00:39:09,500
If you've got the nerve, stop hiding!

734
00:39:09,510 --> 00:39:11,150
I hide because I've got the nerve.

735
00:39:11,160 --> 00:39:12,550
Fine. Keep hiding.

736
00:39:12,550 --> 00:39:13,800
Changzheng, can't you calm down?

737
00:39:13,800 --> 00:39:15,070
Let's see where you can hide!

738
00:39:15,280 --> 00:39:16,880
Then I'll run this way.

739
00:39:18,550 --> 00:39:19,840
I'll teach you a lesson!

740
00:39:23,550 --> 00:39:24,880
Why won't this door open?

741
00:39:24,880 --> 00:39:25,550
I'll smash you!

742
00:39:25,550 --> 00:39:26,280
Master.

743
00:39:27,096 --> 00:39:29,288
Those are Yunzi stones
bestowed by Old Master.

744
00:39:46,480 --> 00:39:48,150
They're merely worldly possessions.

745
00:39:48,760 --> 00:39:49,550
Changzheng,

746
00:39:49,880 --> 00:39:51,230
smash them if you wish.

747
00:39:51,590 --> 00:39:52,880
Follow your heart.

748
00:39:53,710 --> 00:39:55,400
That's what makes a true gentleman.

749
00:39:55,960 --> 00:39:56,590
Thank you.

750
00:39:58,190 --> 00:39:58,590
Changmin.

751
00:39:58,590 --> 00:39:59,710
You're driving me mad!

752
00:40:01,280 --> 00:40:02,400
I'll get you!

753
00:40:03,760 --> 00:40:04,550
Let go of me!

754
00:40:05,920 --> 00:40:06,710
Don't you leave!

755
00:40:13,840 --> 00:40:14,710
Lin Changmin!

756
00:40:14,920 --> 00:40:15,800
Lin Changmin!

757
00:40:16,030 --> 00:40:16,920
I'm over here.

758
00:40:17,110 --> 00:40:18,230
You stop right there!

759
00:40:18,590 --> 00:40:20,320
Why are you still at it, Changzheng?

760
00:40:20,510 --> 00:40:22,030
You've gone too far!

761
00:40:27,760 --> 00:40:28,710
Jinqi,

762
00:40:30,480 --> 00:40:31,880
your second uncle is just like that.

763
00:40:32,360 --> 00:40:34,320
Don't take what he said to heart.

764
00:40:35,590 --> 00:40:36,400
Aunt Lingxiao,

765
00:40:37,000 --> 00:40:39,440
don't worry too much
about Xiuwan's marriage.

766
00:40:39,544 --> 00:40:41,550
I'll settle my own affairs
as soon as possible.

767
00:40:43,110 --> 00:40:43,920
It's fine.

768
00:40:44,880 --> 00:40:46,190
It's fine.

769
00:40:48,070 --> 00:40:49,360
Come sit with me.

770
00:40:50,360 --> 00:40:51,510
We can have a chat.

771
00:41:13,960 --> 00:41:14,760
Young Master.

772
00:41:16,510 --> 00:41:17,070
How did it go?

773
00:41:17,280 --> 00:41:18,230
Did you find anything?

774
00:41:19,840 --> 00:41:22,440
Nanke and I asked everyone along both

775
00:41:22,440 --> 00:41:23,760
the waterways and overland routes

776
00:41:23,760 --> 00:41:24,710
out of Jinling.

777
00:41:24,856 --> 00:41:27,190
No one heard anything
about Lu Dalang leaving Jinling.

778
00:41:28,320 --> 00:41:30,510
A grown man
couldn't simply vanish into thin air.

779
00:41:32,150 --> 00:41:32,840
Perhaps

780
00:41:33,752 --> 00:41:35,590
Lu Dalang
deliberately laid a false trail.

781
00:41:36,760 --> 00:41:38,280
It looked as though he'd left Jinling,

782
00:41:39,280 --> 00:41:41,630
but he's actually
still somewhere in Jinling City.

783
00:41:42,150 --> 00:41:43,070
That must be it.

784
00:41:43,800 --> 00:41:44,880
Otherwise, Nanke and I

785
00:41:44,920 --> 00:41:47,016
couldn't have come up
completely empty-handed.

786
00:41:47,400 --> 00:41:49,710
Even if Lu Dalang
is hiding somewhere in Jinling City,

787
00:41:50,280 --> 00:41:52,040
it'll still be
very difficult to find him.

788
00:41:53,150 --> 00:41:53,960
That's right.

789
00:41:54,880 --> 00:41:56,000
Jinling City is enormous.

790
00:41:56,440 --> 00:41:58,230
He could hole up in any obscure corner,

791
00:41:58,600 --> 00:42:00,280
and even if we searched the entire city,

792
00:42:00,280 --> 00:42:01,400
we still might not find him.

793
00:42:02,360 --> 00:42:05,880
Besides, you're
suspended now, Young Master,

794
00:42:05,928 --> 00:42:08,152
and the Zhao family
is making things difficult for us.

795
00:42:08,190 --> 00:42:09,630
We simply don't have the means

796
00:42:10,760 --> 00:42:12,440
to search every corner of Jinling City.

797
00:42:15,710 --> 00:42:16,630
I have a lead.

798
00:42:35,800 --> 00:42:36,590
Young Master,

799
00:42:36,670 --> 00:42:37,880
I think I have a lead.

800
00:42:39,190 --> 00:42:40,000
You mean

801
00:42:40,504 --> 00:42:42,480
you have a lead
that could help us find Lu Dalang?

802
00:42:44,670 --> 00:42:45,550
I can't find him,

803
00:42:46,480 --> 00:42:48,070
but perhaps I can find

804
00:42:48,070 --> 00:42:49,896
the women who made those padded coats.

805
00:43:00,150 --> 00:43:00,710
How?

806
00:43:05,020 --> 00:43:07,940
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

807
00:43:10,552 --> 00:43:12,520
Young Master,
you've lived a life of privilege.

808
00:43:12,632 --> 00:43:14,808
You don't know that for people
at the bottom like us,

809
00:43:15,070 --> 00:43:16,550
sometimes just staying alive

810
00:43:17,030 --> 00:43:18,590
takes everything we have.

811
00:43:20,000 --> 00:43:21,400
If we want to rise above our station

812
00:43:21,400 --> 00:43:22,590
and live a little better,

813
00:43:23,190 --> 00:43:24,920
we may have to abandon our conscience

814
00:43:25,480 --> 00:43:26,590
and risk our lives.

815
00:43:28,536 --> 00:43:30,264
It's not that
I understand people so well.

816
00:43:30,840 --> 00:43:33,550
It's just like those reed down shoes.

817
00:43:33,752 --> 00:43:35,816
You've never
seen them before, Young Master,

818
00:43:36,110 --> 00:43:37,630
but we see them every day.

819
00:43:37,768 --> 00:43:39,464
There's nothing unusual about them.

820
00:43:57,741 --> 00:44:01,861
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

821
00:44:04,701 --> 00:44:09,221
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

822
00:44:10,501 --> 00:44:14,421
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

823
00:44:15,101 --> 00:44:17,861
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

824
00:44:18,581 --> 00:44:20,901
♪Though all the world may fade♪

825
